  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response and Assistance to Displaced Persons (DP) in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will offer short-term income-generating opportunities for individuals through Cash for Work (CFW). IOM will provide multipurpose cash (MPC) assistance as well as regular food assistance through E-voucher modality to the most vulnerable populations. IOM will build the capacity of a selected local IPs, enabling them to operate independently of IOM and the UN Cross-Border mechanism, as part of a wider risk mitigation strategy for the renewal of the United Nations&#x2019; Security Council Resolutions allowing for Cross-Border assistance into NWS. This comes also within IOM&#x2019;s plans and commitments to support the Localization Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
